# Instance declaration with new pattern syntax
# Verifies the match-arm instance syntax: [instance ClassName [pattern [...]]: methods...]
[
  # Define a simple class
  TestEq: [class [let TestEq a]
    test-eq: [Fn@Boolean [a a]]]

  # Define an instance using the new pattern syntax
  TestEqInt: [instance TestEq
    [pattern [a@Integer]]: test-eq: [fn [let x y] [= x y]]]

  # Use the instance
  result: True
]

---

%.result
=== out
Variant(Boolean.True, Null)
